        "title": "Three Forms of cos 2A",
        "text": "The double angle formula for cosine has THREE equivalent forms:\n\n1. $$\\cos 2A = \\cos^2 A - \\sin^2 A$$\n2. $$\\cos 2A = 2\\cos^2 A - 1$$\n3. $$\\cos 2A = 1 - 2\\sin^2 A$$\n\nAll three are useful in different situations!",
